Third-party code
================

The MuPACE scheduler and the Muon optimizer code in this package are modified
ports of research code that was adapted from the projects below. The ported
files are:

  src/mupace/policy.py
  src/mupace/torch/optimizer.py
  src/mupace/jax/optimizer.py

They were rewritten as standalone NumPy, PyTorch and JAX code and changed by
Jan Kobiolka.


